      "content": "i dont have a database, just some of the notices they leave on my door and what i've seen on the city's public website. here are a few: \n\n- Oct 12, 2am-4am, Maple St (Block 400)\n- Oct 14, 3am-5am, Maple St (Block 400)\n- Oct 15, 1am-3am, Oak Ave (Block 120)\n- Oct 18, 2am-4am, Maple St (Block 400)\n- Oct 19, 3am-5am, Oak Ave (Block 120)\n\nit's always the middle of the night when nobody is looking. why would they need to dig up a pipe at 2am on a Tuesday? it's too quiet for heavy construction. does that sequence look weird to you?",
